[00:12.94]Drink, think, deeply as I sink
{"痛饮 深思 随我一同沉沦"}
[00:19.45]Finally, some place I found peace
{"终于 寻得这方安宁"}
[00:24.99]
[00:25.10]In the dark at night
{"在深夜的黑暗中"}
[00:27.86]Tabletops counters, in the early hours
{"凌晨时分的吧台与柜台"}
[00:31.28]Stone cold inside
{"心如坚石般冰冷"}
[00:33.99]Banging drop stand still, never needing answers
{"碰撞坠落骤然静止 从不需要答案"}
[00:37.43]We wonder all alone but we can’t find the streetlights go
{"我们独自徘徊却寻不到路灯的踪迹"}
[00:43.73]We wonder all alone but can’t deny, we are the streetlight people
{"我们独自徘徊却无法否认 我们是路灯下的人"}
[00:49.66]
[01:00.31]Streetlight people
{"路灯下的人"}
[01:12.71]Streetlight people
{"路灯下的人"}
[01:13.92]
[01:27.42]Hills, trails, chasing whatever kills
{"山丘 小径 追逐任何致命诱惑"}
[01:33.82]For so long I forgot how it feels
{"太久太久 我已忘记那感觉"}
[01:39.20]
